      "cooked": "<p>An event came up that hadn't for a while, and with recent discussions I looked at it in a new light.</p><p>Cause and Effect + Wrong Place and Time.</p><p>Setback has a ton of unlucky, and no bonus damage. &nbsp;So he deals the damage to the 1 target, then when he deals it to himself he discards all his tokens to redirect it.</p><p>Is he redirecting 0 damage now?</p><p>He is, because X would recheck for the new target and find that the amount being dealt is 0. &nbsp;Right?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:16.330Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
