      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/838e76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-10T00:37:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I haven't played Setback much--I think just once.&nbsp;<span>But I'm not following how you're getting 0 damage redirected.</span></p><p>Cause and Effect does X damage to both the target and Setback. Assuming it's the first time this turn a hero target would be dealt damage, Wrong Time and Place activates. If Setback spends the tokens to redirect that damage to a villain target, how does it get reduced to 0 damage redirected?</p>",
